        "quote": "(c) Upon determination by the City Forester that a private property owner has failed to comply with subsection (a) or (b) of this section, the City Forester may take whatever actions are reasonably necessary to remove or treat the vegetation and assess the costs against the property owner pursuant to Chapter 3.45 TMC, Article III . (Ord. 19699 § 9, 2-7-12.)",
